# R3c0n-Blip-X

R3c0n-Blip-X is an automated reconnaissance framework focused on subdomain enumeration and basic network scanning.  
It combines multiple subdomain discovery tools together with Nmap to speed up the recon phase for bug bounty and penetration testing.

## Features

- Multiple subdomain enumeration tools in a single workflow  
- Automatic subdomain deduplication and output saving  
- Integration with Nmap for port scanning of discovered hosts  
- Simple command-line usage, suitable for beginners and intermediate users

